{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Companions is a co-op horror game that responds to every word the players say. Every player is <strong>cursed with a forbidden word</strong>, like &quot;<i>Okay</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>I think</i>&quot;. If anyone says it, the player takes damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/ead89395d70bd6e45570a629b03ef5d3.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/ead89395d70bd6e45570a629b03ef5d3.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/ead89395d70bd6e45570a629b03ef5d3.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/3269073ec55f5ebaeb6118520e903436.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you say the <strong><i>right</i></strong> words, you can heal your friends or disarm traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/e4ff25926d108f4f3eacc01f230b014c.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/e4ff25926d108f4f3eacc01f230b014c.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/e4ff25926d108f4f3eacc01f230b014c.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Mommy loves you... I'm sorry, I'm sorry... IT'S IN THE BOOK! IT'S IN THE BOOK!&quot; - MichiMochievee</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you say the <strong><i>wrong</i></strong> words (i.e. &quot;<i>Follow me!</i>&quot;) you could wipe out your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a4043ac3dfcc10f267ccaedfffbfa34d.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a4043ac3dfcc10f267ccaedfffbfa34d.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a4043ac3dfcc10f267ccaedfffbfa34d.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/cb75afd240449a368b385c94d8e3b295.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are <strong>randomly generated</strong>, every run is a brand-new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/4325386c7195264795fb0b11e73946de.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/4325386c7195264795fb0b11e73946de.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/4325386c7195264795fb0b11e73946de.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/8289933ed974e331b1b37db3a1a8ad66.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over twenty different monsters to encounter and &quot;befriend&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b9f25dd3198b58b7d770f8f986ae8291.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b9f25dd3198b58b7d770f8f986ae8291.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b9f25dd3198b58b7d770f8f986ae8291.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Foul Moth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/9640e1e97e44878d5f1ea1e1721272f6.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/9640e1e97e44878d5f1ea1e1721272f6.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/9640e1e97e44878d5f1ea1e1721272f6.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;[The Foul Moth] kinda looks like a Labubu.&quot; - QuarterJade.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your mouth! </strong>The <strong>Foul Moth</strong> punishes players who swear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Meatgrinder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a58ddef2cddb9653d31a2b165546c793.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a58ddef2cddb9653d31a2b165546c793.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a58ddef2cddb9653d31a2b165546c793.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roast or get roasted! </strong>Shout <strong>&quot;</strong><i>Who's your Daddy!</i>&quot; to send the <strong>Meatgrinder</strong> packing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Bride</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b2b82b8e45b024244fea452047f778d2.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b2b82b8e45b024244fea452047f778d2.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b2b82b8e45b024244fea452047f778d2.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scare The Bride away</strong>! Bad pickup lines and awkward confessions are your best defense! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/d6c9eb6152db41de2e7cc6848a767bbf.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up and tackle a variety of co-op modes. Battle bosses in two standalone stages or dive into tougher dungeons in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>.\u00a0Push your limits in <strong>Endless Mode</strong> to see how long you can survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a5c8b479331ecc0ceb04d1b70626e513.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters aren\u2019t the real threat in Traitor Mode; your so-called friends are. It\u2019s a chaotic social deduction mode where Traitors secretly sabotage the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/134005e1555b8b3974b6d29d8d50d8aa.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/134005e1555b8b3974b6d29d8d50d8aa.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/134005e1555b8b3974b6d29d8d50d8aa.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But don\u2019t be too obvious as others can call an &quot;<i>Emergency Meeting</i>&quot; to vote you out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/c0b3aa23322dbcb2f19cd42209ba34f9.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span>Unlock unique skins as rewards for your greatest achievements! Kill bosses, survive brutal challenges, or simply get killed in unique circumstances.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/19bf5baca22e771b44f3c45c05aa3939.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/19bf5baca22e771b44f3c45c05aa3939.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/19bf5baca22e771b44f3c45c05aa3939.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>\u201cOh that\u2019s nice\u2026 I can be a knight!\u201d - Foolish</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a0cbf76b61fff084a30e9fb5d4d486d2.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your home and let your friends see how cursed your taste really is! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/2d662b048701be40f2bcfa7fa59aaa97.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/2d662b048701be40f2bcfa7fa59aaa97.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/2d662b048701be40f2bcfa7fa59aaa97.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/c34d7e776dc6319396f5639c08af108e.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Control </strong><br>The game is 'always listening', the game uses voice-activation game mechanics. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone gets a forbidden word </strong><br>Like &quot;<i>Okay</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>I think</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>Didn't</i>&quot;. If anyone says it, you take damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Say the right words to get ahead </strong><br>Use your voice to light your torch, to disable traps or shoo monsters away. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Say the wrong words to your peril </strong><br>Your voice can awaken monsters, hurt you and even your teammates.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Dungeons </strong><br>Every run is a brand new experience. The dungeons go deep, so try not to get lost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or Traitor Mode </strong><br>Play as a team in Co-op Mode or find the Traitor in an 'Among Us'-style Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Items </strong><br>Buy equipment like the Teleport Stone, Ice Wand, Stink potions and more. Use the equipment in your own creative ways to try and survive the dungeons and fend off monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Monsters </strong><br>Voice-activated monsters, creatures that track by vision or sound and many more interesting monsters to meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language Mod Support </strong><br>Currently officially supports\u00a0<strong>English, Japanese, French, Spanish and Simplified Chinese</strong>. These languages are in the Language-Beta version of the game: \tGerman, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Polish, Turkish, Italian, Dutch, Korean, Swedish. We have provided easy instructions to add your own language using alternative language voice models.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'm a model","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/55d0829dd301ca6c1d955aa13e6c07e37696c384.jpg"},{"name":"Houseproud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/10dcd67f526669ed365c60c28555191d8c0b99dd.jpg"},{"name":"Extreme Home Makeover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/ab117916e9f7ce423faae93f8b33cf6d075dd58c.jpg"},{"name":"Where's the loot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/9088981bf1fb55d32f66a34cdb6d52a91123ff83.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon's Hoard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/3346260c892c7487947726536cda8f04cc923dee.jpg"},{"name":"Black Market","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/200a7e942cba1deb1c2b3f6acf369864983e9cef.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow Bank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/244ce794dc21d6f13cb4803161d0ed17e66b1a06.jpg"},{"name":"No littering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/a3c587512ee427acbb1d87bba4b1c012e7a281e3.jpg"},{"name":"Clean up crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/8232f51f3bca1186ebcdf41ef69c7e841dd355f0.jpg"},{"name":"For the Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3265230/f7a05415a6641d1d1e5d639f430826152bb1b091.jpg"}],"total":146},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265230?t=1773756376","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773756376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/53674bb7fccb6aac3c8f26e96922d8e50cac1c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773756376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/53674bb7fccb6aac3c8f26e96922d8e50cac1c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773756376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/c87b14f07d3438eba350e55aaf8ad8ab.avif?t=1773756376\" width=1167 height=963 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Companions is a co-op horror game that responds to every word the players say. Every player is <strong>cursed with a forbidden word</strong>, like &quot;<i>Okay</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>I think</i>&quot;. If anyone says it, the player takes damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/ead89395d70bd6e45570a629b03ef5d3.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/ead89395d70bd6e45570a629b03ef5d3.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/ead89395d70bd6e45570a629b03ef5d3.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/3269073ec55f5ebaeb6118520e903436.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you say the <strong><i>right</i></strong> words, you can heal your friends or disarm traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/e4ff25926d108f4f3eacc01f230b014c.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/e4ff25926d108f4f3eacc01f230b014c.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/e4ff25926d108f4f3eacc01f230b014c.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Mommy loves you... I'm sorry, I'm sorry... IT'S IN THE BOOK! IT'S IN THE BOOK!&quot; - MichiMochievee</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you say the <strong><i>wrong</i></strong> words (i.e. &quot;<i>Follow me!</i>&quot;) you could wipe out your team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a4043ac3dfcc10f267ccaedfffbfa34d.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a4043ac3dfcc10f267ccaedfffbfa34d.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a4043ac3dfcc10f267ccaedfffbfa34d.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/cb75afd240449a368b385c94d8e3b295.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are <strong>randomly generated</strong>, every run is a brand-new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/4325386c7195264795fb0b11e73946de.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/4325386c7195264795fb0b11e73946de.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/4325386c7195264795fb0b11e73946de.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/8289933ed974e331b1b37db3a1a8ad66.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over twenty different monsters to encounter and &quot;befriend&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b9f25dd3198b58b7d770f8f986ae8291.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b9f25dd3198b58b7d770f8f986ae8291.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b9f25dd3198b58b7d770f8f986ae8291.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Foul Moth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/9640e1e97e44878d5f1ea1e1721272f6.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/9640e1e97e44878d5f1ea1e1721272f6.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/9640e1e97e44878d5f1ea1e1721272f6.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;[The Foul Moth] kinda looks like a Labubu.&quot; - QuarterJade.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your mouth! </strong>The <strong>Foul Moth</strong> punishes players who swear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Meatgrinder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a58ddef2cddb9653d31a2b165546c793.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a58ddef2cddb9653d31a2b165546c793.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a58ddef2cddb9653d31a2b165546c793.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roast or get roasted! </strong>Shout <strong>&quot;</strong><i>Who's your Daddy!</i>&quot; to send the <strong>Meatgrinder</strong> packing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Bride</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b2b82b8e45b024244fea452047f778d2.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b2b82b8e45b024244fea452047f778d2.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/b2b82b8e45b024244fea452047f778d2.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scare The Bride away</strong>! Bad pickup lines and awkward confessions are your best defense! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/d6c9eb6152db41de2e7cc6848a767bbf.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up and tackle a variety of co-op modes. Battle bosses in two standalone stages or dive into tougher dungeons in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>.\u00a0Push your limits in <strong>Endless Mode</strong> to see how long you can survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a5c8b479331ecc0ceb04d1b70626e513.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters aren\u2019t the real threat in Traitor Mode; your so-called friends are. It\u2019s a chaotic social deduction mode where Traitors secretly sabotage the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/134005e1555b8b3974b6d29d8d50d8aa.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/134005e1555b8b3974b6d29d8d50d8aa.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/134005e1555b8b3974b6d29d8d50d8aa.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But don\u2019t be too obvious as others can call an &quot;<i>Emergency Meeting</i>&quot; to vote you out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/c0b3aa23322dbcb2f19cd42209ba34f9.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span>Unlock unique skins as rewards for your greatest achievements! Kill bosses, survive brutal challenges, or simply get killed in unique circumstances.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/19bf5baca22e771b44f3c45c05aa3939.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/19bf5baca22e771b44f3c45c05aa3939.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/19bf5baca22e771b44f3c45c05aa3939.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>\u201cOh that\u2019s nice\u2026 I can be a knight!\u201d - Foolish</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/a0cbf76b61fff084a30e9fb5d4d486d2.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your home and let your friends see how cursed your taste really is! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/2d662b048701be40f2bcfa7fa59aaa97.poster.avif?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/2d662b048701be40f2bcfa7fa59aaa97.webm?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/2d662b048701be40f2bcfa7fa59aaa97.mp4?t=1773756376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/extras/c34d7e776dc6319396f5639c08af108e.webp?t=1773756376\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Control </strong><br>The game is 'always listening', the game uses voice-activation game mechanics. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone gets a forbidden word </strong><br>Like &quot;<i>Okay</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>I think</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>Didn't</i>&quot;. If anyone says it, you take damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Say the right words to get ahead </strong><br>Use your voice to light your torch, to disable traps or shoo monsters away. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Say the wrong words to your peril </strong><br>Your voice can awaken monsters, hurt you and even your teammates.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Dungeons </strong><br>Every run is a brand new experience. The dungeons go deep, so try not to get lost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or Traitor Mode </strong><br>Play as a team in Co-op Mode or find the Traitor in an 'Among Us'-style Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Items </strong><br>Buy equipment like the Teleport Stone, Ice Wand, Stink potions and more. Use the equipment in your own creative ways to try and survive the dungeons and fend off monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Monsters </strong><br>Voice-activated monsters, creatures that track by vision or sound and many more interesting monsters to meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language Mod Support </strong><br>Currently officially supports\u00a0<strong>English, Japanese, French, Spanish and Simplified Chinese</strong>. These languages are in the Language-Beta version of the game: \tGerman, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, Polish, Turkish, Italian, Dutch, Korean, Swedish. We have provided easy instructions to add your own language using alternative language voice models.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crimson Forge Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265230/header.jpg?t=1773756376","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Crimson Forge Studios","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265230/1394287980/7f8318066d54ef4da41ff4e64d15f83d601bb775/1761581592/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761663821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265230/1394287980/7f8318066d54ef4da41ff4e64d15f83d601bb775/1761581592/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761663821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265230/1394287980/7f8318066d54ef4da41ff4e64d15f83d601bb775/1761581592/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761663821","id":257223226,"name":"Gameplay / How it works","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257223226/e9a6576b28e18141a609aa0d7b326e77bdaa29b5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761663821"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265230/848976/93a487ce127d7ed33db94f1a304a61bf326e4bdb/1750885915/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761663827","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3265230/848976/93a487ce127d7ed33db94f1a304a61bf326e4bdb/1750885915/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761663827","highlight":t